Kaikēyī rebukes senseless grief-struck king --- Kaikēyī cites Śaibya Alarka ocean as truth examples --- Kaikēyī threatens suicide unless pact is honored --- Daśaratha trembles helpless like Bali in Indra noose --- Daśaratha renounces Kaikēyī and her son --- Kaikēyī demands Bharata crowned and Rāma fetched --- Daśaratha begs to see eldest dear Rāma --- Kaikēyī sends rejoicing Sumantra for Rāma